      "rule": "weight + 0.75*r_pack + 0.25*r_cover - 0.08*n_pack + 0.03*n_cover + 0.02*n_edges/max(1e-9,abs(1+degree)) - 0.02*r_edges/max(1e-9,abs(1+compatible_weight))",
      "rationale": "Combines feasible residual packing with a modest upper-summary contribution. Neighborhood and residual structure may distinguish joins that collide on base features or neighborhood edge counts."
